# NOTE: /prescribing-data.js used to be ignored here as a local rebuild
# scratch file. As of 7 Sep 2026 hub/ was promoted to the site root, so this
# file (plus prescribing-data-ext.js) is now the live dataset the deployed
# app loads — it must be tracked. Re-adding an ignore rule for it will ship
# an empty app to GitHub Pages, the exact failure this comment used to warn
# about happening to hub/prescribing-data.js before it existed at this path.
